title: Audit Policy Changed (4719)
id: 65238d99-918c-4332-9a47-cb3b810b0dbc
status: experimental
description: Detects modification of the system audit policy (event 4719), which attackers use to disable auditing of specific categories and reduce visibility into their subsequent actions.
author: Alaris Global
references:
  - https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1562/002/
logsource:
  product: windows
  service: security
detection:
  selection:
    EventID: 4719
  condition: selection
fields:
  - SubjectUserName
  - TargetUserName
  - IpAddress
falsepositives:
  - Administrators tuning audit policy
level: high
tags:
  - attack.defense_evasion
  - attack.t1562.002
